539
00:41:19,710 --> 00:41:22,440
You know, I've been hammering an anvil these past 10 years.

540
00:41:22,440 --> 00:41:24,730
When I hit that steel, it sings.

541
00:41:24,750 --> 00:41:26,630
Are you gonna sing when I hit you?

542
00:41:33,960 --> 00:41:35,890
This is castle-forged steel.

543
00:41:36,450 --> 00:41:37,910
Where'd you steal it?

544
00:41:38,550 --> 00:41:41,190
- It was a gift. - It don't matter now.

545
00:41:41,590 --> 00:41:43,730
Where we're going, they don't care what you've done.

546
00:41:43,750 --> 00:41:48,370
They've got rapers, pickpockets, highwaymen ... murderers.

547
00:41:49,070 --> 00:41:52,620
- Which are you? - Armorer's apprentice.

548
00:41:53,630 --> 00:41:55,120
But my master got sick of me,

549
00:41:55,120 --> 00:41:57,540
so here I am.

550
00:41:57,540 --> 00:42:00,440
Come on, you sorry sons of whores!

551
00:42:01,200 --> 00:42:04,370
It's a thousand leagues from here to the Wall

552
00:42:04,370 --> 00:42:06,530
and winter is coming!

553
00:42:37,610 --> 00:42:38,840
Ham.

554
00:42:39,600 --> 00:42:41,570
How many days in a row must a man be

555
00:42:41,570 --> 00:42:44,220
expected to start his day with ham?

556
00:42:45,020 --> 00:42:47,010
Bring me some beer at least.

557
00:42:49,120 --> 00:42:50,990
You look exhausted.

558
00:42:51,250 --> 00:42:53,710
Was your moonlight ride that tiring?

559
00:42:56,980 --> 00:42:58,760
Don't look so terrified.

560
00:42:58,880 --> 00:43:01,600
If we beheaded everyone that ran away for the night,

561
00:43:01,600 --> 00:43:03,910
only ghosts would guard the Wall.

562
00:43:05,240 --> 00:43:08,120
At least you weren't whoring in Mole's Town.

563
00:43:08,840 --> 00:43:10,560
Honor made you leave,

564
00:43:11,160 --> 00:43:12,920
honor brought you back.

565
00:43:13,600 --> 00:43:15,460
My friends brought me back.

566
00:43:16,280 --> 00:43:18,450
I didn't say it was your honor.

567
00:43:19,620 --> 00:43:20,690
They killed my father.

568
00:43:20,690 --> 00:43:23,370
And you're going to bring him back to life, are you?

569
00:43:23,370 --> 00:43:25,870
No? Good.

570
00:43:25,940 --> 00:43:27,890
We've had enough of that sort of thing.

571
00:43:29,490 --> 00:43:31,330
Beyond the Wall, the rangers are

572
00:43:31,330 --> 00:43:34,450
reporting whole villages abandoned.

573
00:43:34,720 --> 00:43:37,480
At night they see fires blazing in the mountains

574
00:43:37,480 --> 00:43:39,390
from dusk until dawn.

575
00:43:39,940 --> 00:43:41,890
A captured wildling swears their

576
00:43:41,890 --> 00:43:44,920
tribes are uniting in some secret stronghold,

577
00:43:45,110 --> 00:43:48,430
to what ends the gods only know.

578
00:43:48,790 --> 00:43:50,340
Outside Eastwatch

579
00:43:50,340 --> 00:43:53,980
Cotter Pyke's men discovered four blue-eyed corpses.

580
00:43:53,990 --> 00:43:58,090
Unlike us, they were wise enough to burn them.

581
00:43:59,900 --> 00:44:03,120
Do you think your brother's war

582
00:44:03,250 --> 00:44:05,680
is more important than ours?

583
00:44:07,080 --> 00:44:10,560
- No. - When dead men and worse

584
00:44:10,560 --> 00:44:12,170
come hunting for us in the night,

585
00:44:12,170 --> 00:44:15,770
do you think it matters who sits on the Iron Throne?

586
00:44:16,520 --> 00:44:18,670
- No. - Good.

587
00:44:19,010 --> 00:44:21,750
Because I want you and your wolf with us

588
00:44:21,750 --> 00:44:24,400
when we ride out beyond the Wall tomorrow.

589
00:44:25,620 --> 00:44:27,100
Beyond the Wall?

590
00:44:27,120 --> 00:44:31,240
I'll not sit meekly by and wait for the snows.

591
00:44:31,350 --> 00:44:33,700
I mean to find out what's happening.

592
00:44:34,400 --> 00:44:36,710
The Night's Watch will ride in force

593
00:44:36,710 --> 00:44:39,610
against the wildlings, the white walkers

594
00:44:39,610 --> 00:44:41,740
and whatever else is out there.

595
00:44:43,750 --> 00:44:46,350
And we will find Benjen Stark,

596
00:44:46,350 --> 00:44:48,230
alive or dead.

597
00:44:49,110 --> 00:44:51,560
I will command them myself.

598
00:44:52,120 --> 00:44:54,860
So I'll only ask you once, Lord Snow...

599
00:44:55,870 --> 00:44:56,950
Move out!

600
00:44:56,960 --> 00:44:59,590
...Are you a brother of the Night's Watch

601
00:44:59,590 --> 00:45:03,710
or a bastard boy who wants to play at war?

602
00:45:46,140 --> 00:45:49,650
Drogo will have no use for dragon eggs in the night lands.

603
00:45:49,650 --> 00:45:52,410
Sell them. You can return to the free cities

604
00:45:52,420 --> 00:45:54,910
and live as a wealthy woman for all your days.

605
00:45:54,910 --> 00:45:57,260
They were not given to me to sell.

606
00:46:03,370 --> 00:46:05,730
Khaleesi, my queen,

607
00:46:06,670 --> 00:46:09,210
I vow to serve you, obey you,

608
00:46:09,210 --> 00:46:11,640
to die for you if need be,

609
00:46:12,080 --> 00:46:14,380
But let him go, Khaleesi.

610
00:46:14,510 --> 00:46:17,420
I know what you intend. Do not.

611
00:46:17,420 --> 00:46:19,010
I must.

612
00:46:20,670 --> 00:46:22,000
You don't understand...

613
00:46:22,000 --> 00:46:25,830
Don't ask me to stand aside as you climb on that pyre.

614
00:46:25,870 --> 00:46:27,890
I won't watch you burn.

615
00:46:29,400 --> 00:46:31,470
Is that what you fear?

616
00:46:50,700 --> 00:46:53,290
You will be my khalasar.

617
00:46:54,610 --> 00:46:57,360
I see the faces of slaves.

618
00:46:58,110 --> 00:46:59,750
I free you.

619
00:47:00,570 --> 00:47:04,670
Take off your collars. Go if you wish, no one will stop you.

620
00:47:04,690 --> 00:47:06,640
But if you stay,

621
00:47:07,200 --> 00:47:10,960
it will be as brothers and sisters,

622
00:47:10,960 --> 00:47:13,700
as husbands and wives.

623
00:47:25,210 --> 00:47:27,900
Ser Jorah, bind this woman to the pyre.

624
00:47:30,270 --> 00:47:32,230
You swore to obey me.

625
00:47:41,250 --> 00:47:44,520
I am Daenerys Stormborn

626
00:47:44,720 --> 00:47:49,020
of house Targaryen of the blood of old Valyria.

627
00:47:49,020 --> 00:47:51,960
I am the dragon's daughter.

628
00:47:51,960 --> 00:47:54,040
And I swear to you

629
00:47:54,340 --> 00:47:58,370
that those who would harm you will die screaming.

630
00:47:58,370 --> 00:48:00,050
You will not hear me scream.

631
00:48:00,050 --> 00:48:01,550
I will.

632
00:48:03,780 --> 00:48:06,200
But it is not your screams I want.

633
00:48:07,310 --> 00:48:09,180
Only your life.

634
00:50:39,270 --> 00:50:41,380
Blood of my blood.

